          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn, Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a friendly **^^Isharann^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove 1 of this unit&apos;s **soul-quota tokens**. Then, you can re-roll the casting roll.</characteristic>
