            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly **^^Idoneth Deepkin^^** unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target&apos;s melee weapons have **Crit (Auto-wound)** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
